Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.75,0:00:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：铁男和委员长都被那家伙干掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然　这家伙的真面目是个不得了的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.16,0:00:13.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事到如今就由我来做个了断！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.71,0:00:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.97,0:00:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的对手　是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.77,0:00:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你忘了吗你头号粉丝的脸！　！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.33,0:00:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.87,0:00:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于找到你了　。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.89,0:00:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（）凌牙　是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你曾经是我头号粉丝我忘了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候欠的账就让我来还吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.53,0:00:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欠账啊　呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.22,0:00:52.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说起来你那个宝贝妹妹还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}妹妹？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:01:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）这一切都是你一手策划的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都是因为我都是因为我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.87,0:01:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙她……！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要在这里向你复仇！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.94,0:01:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 你说复仇……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.48,0:01:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵……不错 我喜欢我就喜欢 那种的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.89,0:01:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.14,0:01:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（）是决斗锚。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.92,0:01:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 在和我决斗结束之前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.15,0:01:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们都无法离开。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.63,0:01:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙是我的猎物给我滚开！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.83,0:01:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兄长大人 凌牙的卡组里没有 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.54,0:01:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此 兄长大人就没有必要做他的对手了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.91,0:01:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 托隆的命令是绝对的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 粉丝福利到此为止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.69,0:01:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 等等！你要逃吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.55,0:02:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的心灵拼图已经完成了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.94,0:02:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决赛见。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.96,0:02:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.85,0:02:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.09,0:02:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冷静点 兄长很忙的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.22,0:02:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的对手 是我。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.92,0:02:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光体：这些家伙是什么人。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.94,0:02:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个锚和快斗用的一样》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.17,0:02:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这些家伙也拥有和快斗一样的科学力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在收集 No.卡吗！？》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.59,0:02:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）总之先去医院。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.89,0:02:35.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.62,0:02:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟 铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.31,0:02:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们 给我好好看着这场决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边有我们就够了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:45.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.26,0:02:46.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.55,0:02:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也赞成他的意见。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.58,0:02:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.59,0:02:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了，交给我吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.12,0:02:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就按你所愿从你开始打趴下。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.16,0:02:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，哈啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.87,0:03:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗模式，切换！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.90,0:03:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘，设置。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜，设置。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.43,0:03:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像，连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.19,0:05:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由我先来我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.57,0:05:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地魔法 深海王国
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.35,0:05:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动 深海王国！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以让水属性怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升300点。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:32.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇，场地变成水里面了……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.84,0:05:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}氧气瓶！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.98,0:05:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，这里是AR空间。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.88,0:05:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤欧帕兹·玛雅机器！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.30,0:05:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我再盖放一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？欧帕兹是……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:05:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欧帕兹就是指 古代文明中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.60,0:06:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以不可能的技术制造出来的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.58,0:06:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}工艺品。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.43,0:06:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}它的存在 被谜团所包围。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.63,0:06:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.82,0:06:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤锤头鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.85,0:06:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 由于场地魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.73,0:06:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}三剑王国的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.89,0:06:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}锤头鲨的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升３００点！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你似乎{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.78,0:06:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知道我用的是水属性卡组啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 在场地魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.21,0:06:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}三剑王国之中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级4以下的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.86,0:06:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击欧帕兹怪兽这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.64,0:06:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是做不到的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.89,0:06:34.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是你的保险吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.59,0:06:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法卡 下降潮流！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.79,0:06:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 自己怪兽的等级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.48,0:06:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以变成1～3的任意数值。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.85,0:06:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把 锤头鲨的等级下降1级！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.04,0:06:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在打一场奇怪的决斗呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.57,0:06:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更加降低等级你打算做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.94,0:06:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼… 我 特殊召唤大颚鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.80,0:06:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大颚鲨在发动过通常魔法的回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.33,0:07:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌 特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.54,0:07:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大颚鲨也 因三国王国的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 提升300点！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级3的怪兽有2只……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.46,0:07:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级3的锤头鲨和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.99,0:07:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大颚鲨进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.02,0:07:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.13,0:07:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.24,0:07:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.76,0:07:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！黑鳍枪兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.67,0:07:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量是没有等级的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}三剑王国的效果无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.56,0:07:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得漂亮，鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.75,0:07:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！黑鳍枪兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.28,0:07:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击玛雅机械！黑枪刺！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.73,0:07:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！巨石阵之法！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.93,0:07:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}古代遗物怪兽被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.30,0:08:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组将等级4以下的岩石族
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.22,0:08:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}古代遗物怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.50,0:08:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以表侧守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！古代遗物·巨像头！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.25,0:08:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼……我盖放一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.63,0:08:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.99,0:08:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤欧帕兹·黄金穿梭机！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.56,0:08:32.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动永续魔法奥利哈刚锁链！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.27,0:08:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在场上存在时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.46,0:08:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一次超量召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.60,0:08:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将叠放怪兽中的1只{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.66,0:08:39.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}减少。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.35,0:08:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.52,0:08:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是奥利哈刚锁链是有风险的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.38,0:08:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.07,0:08:47.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这个效果超量召唤的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽的控制权会转移给对方。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.45,0:08:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《是打算冒着风险进行超量召唤吗……》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.82,0:08:56.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（）我用等级4的巨像之首
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.56,0:08:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黄金穿梭机{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.52,0:09:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，凭借奥利哈刚锁链的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.27,0:09:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将2只怪兽与奥利哈刚锁链{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.26,0:09:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.29,0:09:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！No.32！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.53,0:09:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（）拥有最强最大力量的深海帝王！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用那獠牙将一切咬碎吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.64,0:09:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（）海咬龙 鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.90,0:09:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.09,0:09:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 他也……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.61,0:09:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.29,0:09:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于三剑王国的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.65,0:09:45.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼龙的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.83,0:09:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升300点！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.69,0:09:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧 鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击黑鳍枪兵！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.90,0:09:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深海撕咬！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.31,0:10:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.34,0:10:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼龙的效果　发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗破坏怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.39,0:10:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.68,0:10:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.59,0:10:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将被破坏的怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.74,0:10:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降１，０００点{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.63,0:10:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在对方的场地上特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.33,0:10:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后　与那只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.52,0:10:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以再次进行战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.88,0:10:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么　那只 No.怪兽能攻击两次吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.92,0:10:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是　这可不是单纯的两次攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这可是　相当强力的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.15,0:10:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼可是会连骨头都吃干净的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.67,0:10:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼龙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.90,0:10:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次　对黑色光线枪兵发动攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.37,0:10:43.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深渊撕咬！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.77,0:10:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.95,0:10:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.83,0:10:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.03,0:10:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.73,0:11:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就凭这种程度 我怎么可能被打倒！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.09,0:11:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再 盖一张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.61,0:11:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.63,0:11:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 只要不把鲨鱼龙想办法解决掉{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.33,0:11:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就 无路可逃了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.85,0:11:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼那家伙 再这样下去的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.05,0:11:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是有一个能扭转这个局面的办法。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.08,0:11:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.78,0:11:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 那个办法…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.95,0:11:23.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把 No.卡夺过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把 No.卡夺过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.63,0:11:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.99,0:11:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 召唤骷髅海怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.26,0:11:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骷髅海怪的效果 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.95,0:11:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.97,0:11:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方场上表侧表示的魔法{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.01,0:11:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡1张可以破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.70,0:11:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我破坏 奥利哈刚锁链！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.12,0:12:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 鲨鱼龙的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.93,0:12:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}控制权 就归我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.66,0:12:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错 就是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.52,0:12:14.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你为了活下去除此之外别无他法。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.72,0:12:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的职责就是…》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.95,0:12:23.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:34.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.28,0:12:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼龙）来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.74,0:12:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接受我吧。 凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.93,0:12:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.45,0:12:58.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接受我释放心之暗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.66,0:13:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.85,0:13:01.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.93,0:13:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再来一场吧。 决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.05,0:13:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一起一飞冲天吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.94,0:13:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么…为什么要放弃决斗啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.31,0:13:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们不是说过是同伴吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.50,0:13:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…但是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.19,0:13:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么好笑的？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.57,0:13:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}害怕输有什么好笑的啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.10,0:13:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼也一定是一样的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.29,0:13:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以鲨鱼的决斗才是真正的决斗！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.50,0:13:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…已经不是那时候的我了～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.41,0:13:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}岂会被你这种人操纵！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:51.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…就是我～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.53,0:13:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然压制住了 No.的力量吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.72,0:13:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.58,0:14:00.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《不会被 No.附身！？》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.11,0:14:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有这家伙的力量的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.13,0:14:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.82,0:14:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对它直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.84,0:14:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.27,0:14:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一击打中的话，就是大伤害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.54,0:14:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没那么容易！陷阱发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.57,0:14:16.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安提基特拉齿轮！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在对方场上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.91,0:14:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有2只以上怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行直接攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.66,0:14:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将攻击怪兽以外的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.21,0:14:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽的控制权{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.36,0:14:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以守备表示获得！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.71,0:14:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想得美！陷阱卡 超水压！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.59,0:14:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是破坏自己1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.29,0:14:39.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组抽1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.16,0:14:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，你的陷阱就失效了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.19,0:14:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.54,0:14:45.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}继续攻击！鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.26,0:14:54.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖上两张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.21,0:15:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…真有你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.24,0:15:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我的任务是把 No.卡交给他。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.12,0:15:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆说过任务完成之后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.64,0:15:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}随便输掉就行虽然这么说了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.17,0:15:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是…别太得意了凌牙！》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.87,0:15:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.07,0:15:20.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.39,0:15:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 上古科技！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.30,0:15:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己墓地里的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.85,0:15:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上古怪兽除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.17,0:15:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组抽两张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.76,0:15:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再把一张送去墓地！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.72,0:15:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我特殊召唤上古水晶骨！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.92,0:15:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在场上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.24,0:15:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有对方怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.16,0:15:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过这个效果特殊召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.19,0:15:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地让先史遗产怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.09,0:15:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水晶头骨特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.07,0:15:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧，水晶头骨！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.81,0:16:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级3的水晶头骨和
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.56,0:16:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水晶骨骼进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.53,0:16:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.01,0:16:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.56,0:16:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.58,0:16:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！先史遗产水晶外星人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.87,0:16:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗1个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合将战斗造成的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.25,0:16:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽破坏无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.89,0:16:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我受到的伤害由对方承受！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.12,0:16:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.09,0:16:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，你场上的鲨鱼龙和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.28,0:16:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怪兽的攻击力之差１，０００点。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.66,0:16:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你会受到　相应数值的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.85,0:16:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧　水晶外星人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.10,0:16:41.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.89,0:16:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反射闪光！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.08,0:16:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了…　这一击要是打中的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.44,0:16:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就结束了　凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.96,0:16:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速攻魔法　板块打捞！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.01,0:16:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}板块打捞可以在２回合内{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.72,0:17:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让场地魔法　无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.32,0:17:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼哎～　浮到水面上了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来三剑王国的效果就消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.88,0:17:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼龙的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.29,0:17:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降３００点！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.59,0:17:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.85,0:17:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…　呃…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.23,0:17:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}漂亮。　通过消除场地魔法的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.25,0:17:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降低鲨鱼龙的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.83,0:17:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}保留下了自己的生命值……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 鲨鱼也 生命值只剩300！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.00,0:17:46.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一击 就能分出胜负。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.19,0:17:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《竟然避开了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水晶外星人的反射闪光……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.90,0:17:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 那家伙下一回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.92,0:17:54.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必定会使用鲨鱼龙的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.53,0:17:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候就是决胜时刻！》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.13,0:18:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖放1张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.00,0:18:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.36,0:18:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用鲨鱼龙 攻击水晶外星人！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.06,0:18:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}深渊撕咬！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.43,0:18:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.15,0:18:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 就是鲨鱼赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.29,0:18:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！我 发动欧帕兹怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.99,0:18:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨像头颅的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.01,0:18:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将这张卡从墓地除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将自己场上的攻击表示怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.94,0:18:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为守备表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.62,0:18:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行 守备怪兽的话的生命值削不掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.36,0:18:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 就在这一刻鲨鱼龙的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.89,0:18:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗破坏怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.25,0:18:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.19,0:18:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将破坏的怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.29,0:18:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降1,000点 特殊召唤到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.50,0:18:51.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方的场地上！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.68,0:18:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘了鲨鱼龙的效果吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.25,0:19:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.79,0:19:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}幸好没有小看你。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.15,0:19:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就知道你能驾驭那张 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.02,0:19:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 叠放射线力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.55,0:19:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.57,0:19:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 在战斗中特殊召唤的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.90,0:19:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽进行战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.29,0:19:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽之间的攻击力互换！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.82,0:19:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来　水晶外星人和鲨鱼龙骑的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.07,0:19:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力就　互换了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.70,0:19:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗　是我赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.23,0:19:30.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.71,0:19:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我这边才是幸好没有小看你。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.45,0:19:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是你的话　我以为你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.97,0:19:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会看穿我使用
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.31,0:19:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼龙骑的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！　深海王的宣告！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.55,0:19:46.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡　将战斗中发动的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.73,0:19:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.42,0:19:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.33,0:19:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.35,0:19:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}继续攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.74,0:20:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼龙骑！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.11,0:20:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.72,0:20:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了　鲨鱼赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.76,0:20:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是惊人的攻防。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.80,0:20:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身手不错。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.82,0:20:33.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天就先算我输吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.03,0:20:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过　我会去决赛的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.55,0:20:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次　再见面时可不会这么简单了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙也把心之碎片集齐了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.46,0:20:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个 No.卡就给你吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.96,0:20:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算是刚才那场决斗的奖励。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.07,0:20:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.44,0:20:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（D视镜的声音）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.77,0:20:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.24,0:21:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在　在医院。　委员长暂时是没事了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.50,0:21:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗　我也马上过去。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.60,0:21:08.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（引擎声）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.21,0:21:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.90,0:21:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马　别再和我扯上关系了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.96,0:21:20.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼　什么复仇之类的…。　鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.68,0:21:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《他再次得到了　No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.27,0:21:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来　总有一天又会和他》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.12,0:21:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）干得不错嘛　。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你总是会回应我的请求。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.18,0:21:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我　只是为了托隆在尽力而为罢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.22,0:21:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谦虚也是你的美德。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.08,0:21:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.93,0:21:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙身上　No.卡并没有附身。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.29,0:21:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不　并非如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.51,0:21:58.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）沉睡在人心中的黑暗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.55,0:22:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要有一丝细小的裂痕就会逐渐蔓延开来。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.95,0:22:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在自己不知不觉之间呢…。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.85,0:24:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗嘉年华的规则来复习一遍吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.03,0:24:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}预选赛为期三天。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.10,0:24:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈特兰城 整个城市都是会场{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.23,0:24:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一旦被挑战决斗就必须应战！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.26,0:24:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}集齐5个心之碎片让心完成的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.96,0:24:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能进入决赛淘汰赛！

